# Citizen proposals are being removed from the app, one deploy at a time (see
# docs/REMOVAL.md). Some polymorphic tables still hold rows that point at them:
# comments, votes, follows, taggings, flags, activities, notifications, and so on.
# Their classes no longer exist, so loading those rows would raise NameError.
# Every reader of those tables skips these types until the rows are deleted.
module RemovedProposals
  TYPES = %w[Proposal ProposalNotification].freeze
end
EOF
